    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Private, Turnkey 3Bedroom SemiDetached Home in a Quiet, Secluded Position \r\n\r\nKathleen Walet of KW Properties is delighted to bring 60 Carraig Gheal , Loughrea to the Market — a well maintained 3bedroom residence offering modern comfort, excellent natural light, and a superb layout ideal for families, firsttime buyers, or those seeking a turnkey home in Loughrea town. \r\n\r\nThis property is set within a quiet, wellkept development just minutes from schools, shops, cafés, and the M6 commuter link. Finished to a high standard throughout, it combines practical design with warm, inviting interiors. Positioned at the rear of the Carraig Gheal estate, No. 60 enjoys a wonderfully private and secluded setting, offering a calm, familyfriendly environment away from passing traffic. \r\n\r\nThe home benefits from oilfired central heating, a feature fireplace, and a separate utility room with WC and sidedoor access to the gated entrance. A small amount of light cosmetic work would further elevate the property, giving buyers an opportunity to add their own finishing touches while enjoying a home that is already in strong, moveinready condition. \r\n\r\nGround Floor Accommodation\r\nLiving Spaces Bright, welcoming living room with feature fireplace Double doors leading to the dining/kitchen area \r\nModern kitchen with excellent storage and garden access \r\nSeparate utility room to the rear with WC and sidedoor access to the gated entrance \r\n\r\nFirst Floor Accommodation \r\n3 Bedrooms- Primary double bedroom with ensuite and fitted wardrobes \r\nSecond double bedroom with fitted wardrobes \r\nSingle bedroom with builtin wardrobe Main family bathroom \r\nA private rear garden offers a safe, lowmaintenance space ideal for outdoor dining or children’s play. The sidedoor access from the utility leads directly to the gated entrance — a rare and highly practical feature. \r\n\r\nFeatures \r\nOilfired central heating \r\nFireplace in living room \r\nFitted wardrobes in all bedrooms \r\nPrivate rear garden \r\nOffstreet parking \r\nPositioned at the rear of the estate in a quiet, secluded setting \r\nWalking distance to Loughrea town centre \r\n\r\nStrong rental and resale demand Ideal for commuters to Galway, Athenry, and the wider region Commuting Distances Galway City: approx. 36 km — 35–40 mins Athenry: approx. 18 km — 15–20 mins Oranmore: approx. 28 km — 25–30 mins Gort: approx. 22 km — 20–25 mins Portumna: approx. 25 km — 25–30 mins Ballinasloe: approx. 28 km — 25–30 mins M6 Motorway Access: approx. 3 km — 5 mins Ennis: approx. 55 km — 45–50 mins Shannon Airport: approx. 70 km — 55–60 mins Limerick City: approx. 75 km — 60–70 mins \r\n\r\n60 Carraig Gheal stands out for its thoughtful layout, excellent storage, and peaceful position within the estate. Homes in this location rarely come to market — early viewing is strongly recommended. \r\n\r\nEnquiries & Viewings Kathleen Walet | KW Properties\r\n085 786 0953 \r\nkathleen.walet@kwireland.com"
      },
